# SwiftFormat (CI runs `swiftformat --lint .`).
#
# Allow-list of whitespace and import hygiene rules, not the full default set:
# the defaults (trailing commas, brace wrapping, redundant self, ...) are
# opinions the code here doesn't follow, and an allow-list also keeps CI stable
# when a newer SwiftFormat adds rules. Add rules here deliberately.
--swiftversion 6.4
--rules indent,trailingSpace,linebreakAtEndOfFile,consecutiveBlankLines,blankLinesAtStartOfScope,blankLinesAtEndOfScope,sortImports,duplicateImports,spaceAroundOperators,spaceAroundParens,spaceAroundBrackets,spaceAroundBraces,spaceInsideParens,spaceInsideBrackets,spaceInsideBraces,spaceAroundComments,spaceInsideComments,semicolons

--indent-strings true
--ranges preserve

# Test files import `Testing` then `@testable import OpenMojiCore`.
--importgrouping testable-last
